        "清理失败期间保持独立外部普通 UI 门，并在清空门前明确跨入非布道日。",
        "操作者记录部分 Open 失败、清理失败与修复及跨日方法，供 GKSA-16 复现。"
      ],
      "profileId": "combined-recovery",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-15"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "注入前独立记录初始前置；预期正常弹窗开关 ON、原生资源健康基线成立、两个门槛与初始布道日成立、状态可读、初始当日机会未消费（阶段专属字段）且该槽该日尚未显示；检查 settings.popupEnabled=true、resource.nativeHealthyAtBaseline=true、save.churchUnlocked=true、save.tutorialCompleted=true、save.isSermonDayBeforeDeferral=true、state.readable=true、state.sermonReadyValueBeforeDeferral>=1、dedup.recordAbsentForThisSlotDayBeforeLoad=true。",
        "在初始安全门清空时安排并观察受控部分原生 Open 失败；预期实际 Open 尝试发生时初始安全门已清空、建立自有清理事务、未成功显示且不花费去重；检查 popup.initialOpenSafetyGateClear=true、popup.partialOpenFailureArranged=true、popup.partialOpenFailureRecorded 存在、popup.ownedCleanupTransactionPresent=true、popup.actualDisplaysBeforeRecovery=0。",
        "在清理失败期间跨日离开布道日且保持外部门；预期在既有事务上观察到实际清理失败、故障排队、跨日成立且占用期间零实际通知；检查 popup.cleanupFailureObservedOnExistingTransaction=true、popup.cleanupFailureInjectionRecorded 存在、notice.queuePendingDuringUnsafe=true、notice.displayAttemptCount=0、popup.displayedWhileOccupied=false、save.isSermonDay=false、save.dateChangedDuringDeferral=true、popup.dayCrossedBeforeGateClear=true、popup.externalGateHeldDuringRepair=true。",
        "移除注入的初始 Open 失败条件（观察资源恢复）并受控修复自有清理；预期资源恢复、清理完成且无残留类别故障、未显示队列被取消；检查 popup.availableAfterResourceRestore=true、popup.cleanupRepaired=true、popup.cleanupRepairRecorded 存在、popup.categoryFaultRemainingAfterRepair=false、notice.queuePendingAfterRepair=false、popup.actualDisplaysBeforeRecovery=0。",
        "在最终外部 UI 门仍保持、清理修复完成后记录累计正常显示与记录状态；预期累计正常显示仍为 0 且该槽该日尚未写入记录；检查 popup.externalGateHeldDuringRepair=true、popup.actualDisplaysBeforeRecovery=0、popup.recordAfterPartialOpenRepair=false。",
        "修复后才清空外部 UI 门；预期按当前非布道日判定且零正常弹窗输出；检查 ui.safetyGateClear=true、popup.eligibleOnRecovery=false、popup.actualDisplaysAfterGateCleared=0、popup.newDisplaysAfterGateCleared=0、notice.staleNoticeAfterRecovery=false、notice.popupDisplayedCount=0。"
